\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {5}{\ignorespaces \textbf  {Deferred numbers: every interval, ladder, and subset endpoint quoted as a single number in the prose.} All intervals are bootstrap 95\%; the completer-sweep and phi-4 rows are computed on the 42 anchor traces the pairs file covers, and the item-level paired bootstraps (the answer-line intervention and the P-L1 control alike) condition on the fixed twelve models, so they capture item-sampling uncertainty only. The item-share rows report the bootstrap CI over items alongside the range of the share under deletion of any single model (the model-deletion jackknife).}}{22}{table.caption.19}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{tab:robust}{{5}{22}{\textbf {Deferred numbers: every interval, ladder, and subset endpoint quoted as a single number in the prose.} All intervals are bootstrap 95\%; the completer-sweep and phi-4 rows are computed on the 42 anchor traces the pairs file covers, and the item-level paired bootstraps (the answer-line intervention and the P-L1 control alike) condition on the fixed twelve models, so they capture item-sampling uncertainty only. The item-share rows report the bootstrap CI over items alongside the range of the share under deletion of any single model (the model-deletion jackknife)}{table.caption.19}{}}
